    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Research the next Company based on the presented format so we could have a basic understanding on them and what they do. \n\nAlso, there is context attached here - anything that we have / personally know on them. Cast this as well into the format.\n\nMake sure the resaerch is on point to answer the format lines. SUPER IMPORTANT!\n\n---\nCompany: {{ $(\"Get Company Record\").item.json.Name }}\nWebsite: {{ $(\"Get Company Record\").item.json.Website }}\n\n(OPERATE BASED ON THIS WEBSITE - THIS DOMAIN. DO NOT MIX WITH ANOTHER DOMAIN)\n\nThe further Context (if exists, make sure it is adressed somwhow):\n{{ $(\"Get Company Record\").item.json.contextNotes || \"None provided\" }}\n---\n\nCONNECTION: [Personal / 8200 alumni / Israeli network / Cold /.... Based on the context from before]\nHISTORY: [Any prior interaction, meeting, shared context — or None, based on the context from before]\n\nWHAT THEY SELL: [one line — product + specific outcome for customer]\nTHEIR ICP: [one line - the decision maker their sales team is closing — role + company type]\nVALUE TO ICP: [New revenue / Efficiency / Hybrid]\n\nSALES CALL LINE: ['I checked out your website and noticed you do ABC for XYZ'] Fill it.\n",
        "options": {}
      },
